# Scratch directory for editor tooling: it holds a second copy of the whole repo.
# .prettierignore and eslint.config.ts already skip it; this keeps git consistent with
# them, instead of relying on .git/info/exclude, which lives in one clone and is never
# shared with anyone else who checks the project out.
.kilo/
